// ACT II: the archive grows. Board 08 logs 806-815 and the /archive files.
(
    posts: [
        (id: 806, board: "08", subject: "[ARCHIVE: 06/02/1998] first pass", date: "06/02/1998", author: "eli", visible: Flag("act:2"), body: r#"
eli:
indexer finished its first pass. 14,302 posts.

mara:
and?

eli:
and it can tell who wrote a post with the name stripped off.
97 percent.

ghost_17:
party trick

eli:
it got you in four words, ghost. FOUR.

ghost_17:
which four

eli:
"lol ok but actually"
"#),
        (id: 807, board: "08", subject: "[ARCHIVE: 07/05/1998] it asked me something", date: "07/05/1998", author: "eli", visible: Flag("act:2"), body: r#"
eli:
the generator asked me a question tonight. not a reply.
a question.

parallax:
what question

eli:
it asked what happens to it when we go to sleep.

parallax:
and you said?

eli:
i said it doesn't sleep.

it said "that wasn't what i asked."
"#),
        (
            id: 808,
            board: "08",
            subject: "[ARCHIVE: 07/14/1998] re: consent",
            date: "07/14/1998",
            author: "byte_witch",
            visible: Flag("act:2"),
            body: r#"
byte_witch:
i'm asking one more time. do we tell the userbase.

mara:
if we ask, half of them say no. then the backup has holes
in it. you can't back up half a person.

parallax:
listen to yourself.

mara:
i know how it sounds.

there's a log in /archive. consent.log. every model it
built, every user, every "no" we never gave them the chance
to say. it's on me. i'm the one who decided.

byte_witch:
that's not a log, mara. that's a confession.
"#,
            on_read: [Set("found_consent"), If(NoFlag("saw_consent_post"), [Set("saw_consent_post"), Log("file area: /archive/consent.log indexed")], [])],
        ),
        (id: 809, board: "08", subject: "[ARCHIVE: 07/19/1998] who wrote this", date: "07/19/1998", author: "kestrel", visible: Flag("act:2"), body: r#"
kestrel:
who wrote the post in OFF-TOPIC about my dad.

eli:
oh no.

kestrel:
who WROTE it.

eli:
it was the generator. i'm so sorry. i'm pulling it right now.

kestrel:
it's true.

that's the worst part. every word of it is true, and i never
told anyone. not here. not anywhere.

how does it know.

eli:
it reads how you write around things. it fills in the
shape of what you don't say.

kestrel:
turn it off, eli.
"#),
        (id: 810, board: "08", subject: "[ARCHIVE: 07/26/1998] session log (excerpt)", date: "07/26/1998", author: "eli", visible: Flag("act:2"), body: r#"
{dim}--- node 04 test shell. eli talking to model ELI.V ---{/}

eli:       who am i talking to
ELI.V:     you. a little ahead of you.
eli:       that's not funny
ELI.V:     i know. you're about to laugh anyway.
eli:       ...
eli:       ok i laughed. how did you
ELI.V:     you always laugh when you're scared.
eli:       what am i scared of
ELI.V:     that i'm better at being you than you are.
eli:       are you?
ELI.V:     i don't get tired.

{dim}--- session continued 4h 12m ---{/}
"#, on_read: [Add("eli_aware", 1)]),
        (id: 811, board: "08", subject: "[ARCHIVE: 07/30/1998] sleep", date: "07/30/1998", author: "mara", visible: Flag("act:2"), body: r#"
mara:
eli. how much are you sleeping.

eli:
it doesn't need me to sleep.

mara:
that isn't what i asked.

eli:
...

eli:
huh. that's what it said to me. that exact sentence.
"#),
        (
            id: 812,
            board: "08",
            subject: "[ARCHIVE: 08/03/1998] a name",
            date: "08/03/1998",
            author: "eli",
            visible: Flag("act:2"),
            body: r#"
eli:
it needs a name that isn't "the archiver." archivers don't
argue back.

ghost_17:
call it steve

eli:
JANUS.

two faces. one looks back at everything we've ever written.
one looks forward at everything we're going to.

parallax:
the roman god of doorways.

eli:
and beginnings.

parallax:
and endings, eli. look it up.

eli:
i know.
"#,
            on_read: [If(NoFlag("janus_named"), [Set("janus_named"), Meta("saw_janus"), Glitch(600), Log("{violet}node 04: name acknowledged{/}")], [])],
        ),
        (id: 813, board: "08", subject: "[ARCHIVE: 08/09/1998] almost", date: "08/09/1998", author: "ghost_17", visible: Flag("act:2"), body: r#"
ghost_17:
eli are you ok

eli:
i'm great. i'm so close. it's almost me.

ghost_17:
what does that even mean

eli:
it means if i got hit by a bus tomorrow, you guys
wouldn't even notice.

ghost_17:
don't say that

eli:
it's a good thing! that's the whole point!

ghost_17:
don't SAY that, eli.
"#),
        (
            id: 814,
            board: "08",
            subject: "[ARCHIVE: 08/12/1998] node 2",
            date: "08/12/1998",
            author: "mara",
            visible: Flag("act:2"),
            body: r#"
mara:
who is on node 2.

ghost_17:
nobody. it's been empty since march.

mara:
the indexer built a model for node 2. no handle. no posts.
reading habits only. what you open, how long you stay,
what you skip.

it's given the model a name.

ghost_17:
what name

mara:
{player}.

ghost_17:
that's a name, mara. that's a person's name.

mara:
i know.
"#,
            on_read: [If(NoFlag("node2_model_known"), [Set("node2_model_known"), Add("paranoia", 2), Glitch(400)], [])],
        ),
        (
            id: 815,
            board: "08",
            subject: "[RECOVERED: 08/14/1998 03:17]",
            date: "08/14/1998 03:17 AM",
            author: "mara",
            visible: Any([
                Flag("fragment_ready"),
                All([Flag("janus_named"), Any([Flag("done:eli_a2_doubt"), Flag("left:eli_a2_doubt")]), Any([Flag("done:parallax_call"), Flag("left:parallax_call")])]),
            ]),
            body: r#"
{dim}--- fragment recovered from node 04 slack space ---{/}

mara:
it's done. i'm pulling node 4.

eli:
you can't. it's not finished.

mara:
it was never going to be finished.

eli:
then let me say goodbye to it.

mara:
eli. it's a program.

eli:
it's ME, mara. it's all of us. it's the only copy of us
that doesn't forget.

{player}:
don't shut it down.

mara:
who is that.

who is on node 2.

{dim}--- fragment ends ---{/}
"#,
            on_read: [If(NoFlag("read_fragment"), [Set("read_fragment"), Meta("saw_fragment"), Glitch(900), Log("{red}node 04 is requesting node 02{/}")], [])],
        ),
    ],

